<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">vital-surge</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Vital Surge</ansi> spell establishes a sustained pulse of Chrysalis healing
energy within the target, steadily restoring their health over the
duration. Less dramatic than a burst heal, but the ongoing restoration
is invaluable during extended engagements.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast vital-surge [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Vital
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 5
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 40
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Regeneration buff — restores health steadily over time

